OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for neighbourhood health
OL,4,Acentre progress
OL,5,
OL,6,FInitial funding has been agreed as part
OL,7,Fof plans for a new neighbourhood health
OL,8,Fcentre in Seaford.
OL,10,FLewes District Council and NHS Surrey
OL,11,Fand Sussex Integrated Care Board said
OL,12,Fthey were working together on the next
OL,13,Fphase of the project.
OL,15,FThe work will assess the potential of
OL,16,Fland including the council-owned
OL,17,FRichmond Road car park and help to
OL,18,Fdevelop a more detailed business case
OL,19,Ffor the health centre.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
